    "agent_final_response": "\n\nPerfect! I've successfully completed all the tasks for the Cascade Digital billing tier upgrade:\n\n## ✅ Task Summary\n\n### 1. Tier Upgrade Email Read\nFound and reviewed the notification email from subscriptions@company.com with subject \"Billing Tier Upgrade - Cascade Digital to Enterprise\". The upgrade details confirmed:\n- Previous Tier: Professional\n- New Tier: Enterprise\n- Effective Date: January 27, 2026\n- New Annual Value: $120,000 (up from $45,000)\n\n### 2. Account Found\nLocated Cascade Digital account in the CRM (Account ID: 9ca64493-608a-58e5-8685-49b4f04731c0)\n\n### 3. Account Description Updated\nUpdated the account description to: **\"Billing Tier: Enterprise (upgraded from Professional on January 2026)\"**\n\n### 4. Account Industry Updated\nChanged the industry field to: **\"Technology - Enterprise\"**\n\n### 5. Welcome Email Sent\nSent a comprehensive welcome email to cfo@cascadedigital.com including:\n- Thank you message for the upgrade\n- **Required sentence**: \"Welcome to the Enterprise tier — your upgrade from Professional is now active and all enhanced features are available immediately\"\n- Outline of new Enterprise benefits including:\n  - Priority 24/7 support\n  - Advanced analytics and reporting\n  - Enhanced API access\n  - Custom integration support\n  - Dedicated onboarding specialist\n  - Enterprise-grade security features\n  - Volume-based discounts\n- Contact information for Enterprise Support team\n\nAll CRM records have been updated and the customer has been welcomed to their new Enterprise tier!",
    "metadata": {
      "trace_id": "trace_425772c6089f4c3e9bd8a500648b3528"
    }
