    {
      "role": "agent",
      "action": "send_email(to=\"cfo@cascadedigital.com\", subject=\"Welcome to Enterprise Tier - Cascade Digital\", body=\"Dear Cascade Digital Team,\n\nThank you for upgrading to our Enterprise tier! We are thrilled to welcome you to this enhanced service level.\n\nWelcome to the Enterprise tier — your upgrade from Professional is now active and all enhanced features are available immediately.\n\nAs an Enterprise customer, you now have access to:\n- Priority 24/7 support with dedicated account management\n- Advanced analytics and reporting capabilities\n- Enhanced API access with higher rate limits\n- Custom integration support\n- Dedicated onboarding specialist\n- Enterprise-grade security features and compliance tools\n- Volume-based discounts on add-on services\n\nYour annual subscription value has been updated to $120,000, effective January 27, 2026.\n\nWe are committed to ensuring you get maximum value from your Enterprise tier. Our dedicated support team will reach out to schedule your onboarding session and discuss how to best leverage these new features for your organization.\n\nIf you have any questions or need assistance getting started, please don't hesitate to reach out to our Enterprise Support team at enterprise-support@company.com or call us at +1-555-SUPPORT.\n\nThank you for your continued partnership. We look forward to supporting your success at the Enterprise level!\n\nBest regards,\nCustomer Success Team\")",
